msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Universal Screensaver with video plugin source support"
msgstr "Universal Screensaver with video plugin source support"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "The Universal Screensaver displays a slideshow of images using various transition effects. Sources include video fanart, music fanart, a custom image folder, or a video plugin path. Plugin images are cached locally at 1080p 16:9."
msgstr "The Universal Screensaver displays a slideshow of images using various transition effects. Sources include video fanart, music fanart, a custom image folder, or a video plugin path. Plugin images are cached locally at 1080p 16:9."

